abstract: >-
  An open, bilingual (Chinese/English) curriculum that teaches no-limit Texas Hold'em strategy
  from derivable first principles. Every numeric claim in the lessons and in the interactive
  trainer is generated by the pokergto Python engine and committed as a deterministic JSON
  artifact; solver results are gated against closed-form anchors (Kuhn poker's game value of
  -1/18, bluff indifference, minimum defense frequency), and every strategy artifact carries a
  machine-readable provenance record. The repository contains no solver output from commercial
  tools.
